  "description": "A low-poly model of a restyled American compact sedan from the late '90s in a police package.\nI decided to make a police car, inspired by the base model used in MW and up until the dawn of PS2 era. I know the car represents full-size police sedan in the game, but due gameplay it looks more like something much smaller. I wanted to simplify the process, so I chose a Murphy '92 as the platform for the restyle, with minimal changes\u2014the hood and headlights.\n\nPS - If that Hommage livery is too exesive, use more nutral from '92 model. All the components are interchangable - there's not to many.\n\nI un",
